            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "{prep_date}",
                    "text_style": {
                        "leftIndent": 340.0,
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "<b><i>Re: Medication Opportunity \u2013 PLEASE REVIEW</i></b>",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Dear {provider_first_name} {provider_last_name},",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "We\u2019re contacting you because we\u2019ve identified a potential medication-related concern for your patient(s). Please review the attached patient and evidence-based guideline information and assess whether a change in therapy is necessary. If you feel no changes are needed upon review of the attached information, please disregard this, and future, communication on this matter. <i>We value the patient-provider relationship and trust your professional judgement to determine the best course of action for your patient.</i>",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "<b>Why\u2019s this important?</b>",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceAfter": 0.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "We\u2019re committed to supporting you in your work and ensuring the therapies members receive are safe and effective. We\u2019ve partnered with Arine to help identify potential medication-related concerns that may impact health outcomes for our members. ",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceBefore": 0.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "<b> How do we identify eligible members?</b>",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceAfter": 0.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "We continuously monitor pharmacy and medical claims data using evidence-based guidelines to identify potential medication gaps and related concerns. This information is then shared with our providers to review and determine if an adjustment to the patient\u2019s regimen is necessary. ",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceBefore": 0.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "<b>Why are you receiving this letter?</b>",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceAfter": 0.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "According to our pharmacy claims data, the patients in this document received a paid prescription at their preferred pharmacy with your national identification number (NPI) identified as the prescriber. We recognize that you may have written some patients\u2019 prescriptions at other sites of service, however we\u2019re sending this letter to you at this address because it\u2019s most associated with your Drug Enforcement Administration (DEA) file.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceBefore": 0.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Sincerely,",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText",
                        "spaceBefore": 24.0
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Priority Health",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
